                    """(description) Publication form: book. Publisher: 精硏社. Contained in: 人氣스타아 書翰文.
(description) UeDeKo remark: Presents letters from literary works alongside fan letters; names Werther, the letter writer, as author and adds the subtitle \"from Goethe's The Sorrows of Young Werther\"
(compilation) UeDeKo's source translation type and work translation type differ (source 'partial; adaptation', work 'adaptation')."""@en .
